#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:2
msgid "lmcache server"
msgstr "lmcache server"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache server`` command launches the standalone LMCache Multi-"
"Process (MP) server, which exposes a configurable ZMQ or gRPC request "
"endpoint and an HTTP frontend (status, healthcheck, cache-clear, checksum"
" APIs). It is the server that ``lmcache describe``, ``lmcache ping "
"kvcache``, ``lmcache kvcache``, and ``lmcache bench server`` talk to."
msgstr "``lmcache server`` 命令启动独立的 LMCache 多进程 (MP) 服务器，该服务器暴露可配置的 ZMQ 或 gRPC 请求端点和 HTTP 前端（状态、健康检查、清除缓存、校验和 API）。这是 ``lmcache describe``、``lmcache ping kvcache``、``lmcache kvcache`` 和 ``lmcache bench server`` 进行交互的服务器。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:12
msgid ""
"This command requires the full ``lmcache`` installation with CUDA "
"extensions. It is **not** available in the lightweight ``lmcache-cli`` "
"package."
msgstr "此命令需要完整的 ``lmcache`` 安装，并带有 CUDA 扩展。它在轻量级的 ``lmcache-cli`` 包中 **不可用**\\ 。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:21
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:31
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:33
msgid ""
"The server composes its arguments from several configuration modules — "
"the multiprocess server, the storage manager (L1 / L2 adapters / "
"eviction), the HTTP frontend, and the Prometheus / telemetry "
"observability layer. The full, authoritative list is large and evolves "
"with the runtime, so consult:"
msgstr ""
"服务器从多个配置模块组合其参数——多进程服务器、存储管理器（L1 / L2 适配器 / 逐出）、HTTP 前端以及 Prometheus / "
"监控可观察性层。完整的权威列表很大，并随着运行时而变化，因此请参考："

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:42
msgid "Commonly used flags include:"
msgstr "常用的标志包括："

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:48
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:49
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--transport {zmq,grpc}``"
msgstr "``--transport {zmq,grpc}``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:51
msgid "Request transport exposed by the server (default: ``zmq``)."
msgstr "服务器公开的请求传输方式（默认：``zmq``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:52
msgid "``--host HOST``"
msgstr "``--host HOST``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:53
msgid "Bind address for the server."
msgstr "服务器的绑定地址。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:54
msgid "``--port PORT``"
msgstr "``--port PORT``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:55
msgid "Request-transport port."
msgstr "请求传输端口。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:56
msgid "``--chunk-size N``"
msgstr "``--chunk-size N``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:57
msgid "KV cache chunk size in tokens."
msgstr "KV Cache 块大小（以 token 为单位）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:58
msgid "``--l1-size-gb GB``"
msgstr "``--l1-size-gb GB``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:59
msgid "L1 (CPU/DRAM) cache capacity in GB."
msgstr "L1 (CPU/DRAM) 缓存容量（以 GB 为单位）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:60
msgid "``--eviction-policy POLICY``"
msgstr "``--eviction-policy POLICY``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:61
msgid "L1 eviction policy (``LRU``, ``ARC``, ``IsolatedLRU``, or ``noop``)."
msgstr "L1 逐出策略 (``LRU``, ``ARC``, ``IsolatedLRU``, 或 ``noop``)。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:62
msgid "``--eviction-trigger-watermark RATIO``"
msgstr "``--eviction-trigger-watermark RATIO``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:63
msgid "L1 fill ratio at which eviction begins."
msgstr "开始逐出的 L1 填充比率。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:64
msgid "``--eviction-ratio RATIO``"
msgstr "``--eviction-ratio RATIO``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:65
msgid "Fraction of L1 cleared per eviction cycle."
msgstr "每个逐出周期清除的 L1 分数。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:66
msgid "``--max-workers N``"
msgstr "``--max-workers N``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:67
msgid "Base number of request worker threads."
msgstr "请求工作线程的基本数量。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:68
msgid "``--grpc-server-workers N``"
msgstr "``--grpc-server-workers N``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:69
msgid "gRPC dispatch threads (used only with ``--transport grpc``)."
msgstr "gRPC 调度线程（仅在使用 ``--transport grpc`` 时使用）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:70
msgid "``--coordinator-url URL``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-url URL``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:71
msgid ""
"Register with an MP coordinator at this base URL (e.g. "
"``http://coordinator:9300``). Opt-in; enables fleet registration. See "
":doc:`/mp/coordinator`."
msgstr ""
"在此基础 URL（例如 ``http://coordinator:9300``\\ ）注册 MP 协调器。可选；启用车队注册。请参见 "
":doc:`/mp/coordinator`。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:74
msgid "``--coordinator-advertise-ip IP``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-advertise-ip IP``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:75
msgid ""
"IP the coordinator should reach this server at (defaults to the outbound "
"IP)."
msgstr "协调器应通过此服务器访问的 IP（默认为出站 IP）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:77
msgid "``--coordinator-heartbeat-interval SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-heartbeat-interval SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:78
msgid ""
"Seconds between heartbeats (``> 0``, default ``5``). Keep well below the "
"coordinator's instance timeout."
msgstr "心跳之间的秒数（\\ ``> 0``\\ ，默认值为 ``5``\\ ）。应远低于协调器的实例超时。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:80
msgid "``--coordinator-event-reporting``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-event-reporting``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:81
msgid ""
"Stream cache store/access/delete events to the coordinator, feeding the "
"key directory (fleet-wide placement tracking), L2 usage/quota tracking "
"and eviction, and the blend index behind fleet CacheBlend matching."
msgstr ""
"将流缓存存储/访问/删除事件发送到协调器，提供关键目录（全舰队放置跟踪）、L2 使用/配额跟踪和逐出，以及舰队 CacheBlend "
"匹配背后的混合索引。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:84
msgid "``--coordinator-event-flush-interval SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-event-flush-interval SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:85
msgid "Seconds between cache-event batch flushes (``> 0``, default ``1``)."
msgstr "缓存事件批量刷新之间的秒数（``> 0``，默认值为``1``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:86
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--coordinator-event-transport {http,kafka}``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-event-transport {http,kafka}``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:87
msgid ""
"Cache-event transport (default ``http``). ``kafka`` publishes each batch "
"to a Kafka topic instead of ``POST /events``; it needs the optional "
"``lmcache[kafka]`` extra. See :doc:`/mp/coordinator`."
msgstr "缓存事件传输（默认 ``http``）。``kafka`` 将每个批次发布到 Kafka 主题，而不是 ``POST /events``；它需要可选的 ``lmcache[kafka]`` 扩展。请参阅 :doc:`/mp/coordinator`。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:90
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-bootstrap-servers SERVERS``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-bootstrap-servers SERVERS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:91
msgid ""
"Comma-separated Kafka bootstrap servers. Required with ``--coordinator-"
"event-transport kafka``."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的 Kafka 启动服务器。与 ``--coordinator-event-transport kafka`` 一起使用是必需的。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:93
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-topic TOPIC``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-topic TOPIC``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:94
msgid "Kafka topic receiving cache events (default ``lmcache-cache-events``)."
msgstr "接收缓存事件的 Kafka 主题（默认 ``lmcache-cache-events``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:95
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-delivery-timeout SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-delivery-timeout SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:96
msgid ""
"Seconds one flush waits for broker acknowledgement (``> 0``, default "
"``10``)."
msgstr "每次刷新等待代理确认的秒数（``> 0``，默认值为 ``10``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:98
msgid "``--p2p-advertise-url HOST:PORT``"
msgstr "``--p2p-advertise-url HOST:PORT``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:99
msgid ""
"Enable P2P KV cache sharing and advertise this server's transfer-channel "
"endpoint to peers (e.g. ``10.0.0.1:8500``). Setting it turns P2P on; it "
"additionally requires ``--coordinator-url`` for peer discovery. See "
":doc:`/mp/p2p`."
msgstr ""
"启用 P2P KV Cache 共享，并将此服务器的传输通道端点广告给对等方（例如 ``10.0.0.1:8500``）。设置它会开启 "
"P2P；此外还需要 ``--coordinator-url`` 进行对等发现。请参见 :doc:`/mp/p2p`。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:103
msgid "``--p2p-listen-url HOST:PORT``"
msgstr "``--p2p-listen-url 主机:端口``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:104
msgid ""
"Address the transfer-channel server binds to. Defaults to ``--p2p-"
"advertise-url``. Set it when the advertised address differs from the bind"
" address (e.g. bind ``0.0.0.0`` while advertising a routable IP)."
msgstr ""
"传输通道服务器绑定的地址。默认为 ``--p2p-advertise-url``。当广告地址与绑定地址不同（例如，绑定 ``0.0.0.0`` "
"而广告一个可路由的 IP）时，请设置它。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:107
msgid "``--p2p-lookup-timeout SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--p2p-lookup-timeout SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:108
msgid "Deadline for a peer lookup before it counts as a miss (default ``30``)."
msgstr "对等查找的截止时间，超过该时间将视为未命中（默认 ``30``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:109
msgid "``--p2p-load-timeout SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--p2p-load-timeout SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:110
msgid ""
"Deadline for a peer KV read before it counts as a failure (default "
"``30``)."
msgstr "对等 KV 读取的截止时间，超过该时间将视为失败（默认 ``30``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:112
msgid "``--p2p-transfer-engine ENGINE``"
msgstr "``--p2p-transfer-engine ENGINE``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:113
msgid "Transfer-channel implementation for P2P reads (default ``nixl``)."
msgstr "P2P 读取的传输通道实现（默认 ``nixl``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--trace-level {storage,events}``"
msgstr "``--trace-level {storage,events}``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:115
msgid ""
"Enable trace recording: ``storage`` records StorageManager calls for "
"replay, ``events`` records the cache-event stream emitted for the "
"coordinator, with or without one configured (see :doc:`trace`)."
msgstr "启用跟踪记录：``storage`` 记录 StorageManager 调用以供重放，``events`` 记录为协调器发出的缓存事件流，无论是否配置（请参见 :doc:`trace`）。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:118
msgid "``--trace-output PATH``"
msgstr "``--trace-output PATH``"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:119
msgid "Destination for recorded ``.lct`` trace files."
msgstr "记录的 ``.lct`` 跟踪文件的目标。"

#: ../../source/cli/server.rst:121
msgid ""
"L2 adapters, observability, and Prometheus exporters are configured "
"through their own flag groups; see ``lmcache server --help`` for the "
"complete set."
msgstr ""
"L2 适配器、可观察性和 Prometheus 导出器通过各自的标志组进行配置；有关完整的设置，请参见 ``lmcache server "
"--help``\\ 。"

